      'Bilingual health information chatbots deployed for an NGO cervical cancer awareness campaign. n8n automation, WhatsApp Cloud API; handled 200+ patient queries in the pilot month.',
    tags: ['n8n', 'WhatsApp Cloud API', 'Health-tech'],
  },
  {
    name: 'INKWAVE Platform',
    url: 'https://inkwave-cm.vercel.app/',
